UID:N0DS_Mb_0ZAYbJBe9pf3m
SUMMARY:Wheelhouse Wednesday Lecture Series: Freedom Needed A Harbor
DTSTAMP:20260718T100659Z
DTSTART:20260722T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Please join us on Wednesday\, July 22nd from 6-7:30pm as we rec
	hristen our monthly lecture series\, “Wheelhouse Wednesday.” Our guest for
	 this inaugural lecture will be Darren Shelton\, Vice President at Moran S
	hipping and HMCM Board member\, presenting “Freedom Needed A Harbor: Celeb
	rating 250 Years of American Freedom Through the Story of the Houston Ship
	 Channel.” \nTickets are $5\n\nhttps://houstonmaritime.org/event/wheelhous
	e-wednesday-freedom-needed-a-harbor/\n\nFrom Houston Maritime Museum
URL:https://houstonmaritime.org/event/wheelhouse-wednesday-freedom-needed-a
	-harbor/
LOCATION:Houston Maritime Center & Museum\, 2940 Riverby Rd\, Suite 200\, H
	ouston\, TX\, 77020\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-maritime-museum
CATEGORIES:Houston Maritime Museum
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
